                  <div class="faq-content">
                    <div class="font-medium is-faq">What types of industrial equipment do you offer?</div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="font-regular is-faq">We feature equipment categories such as material handling systems, lifting equipment, conveyor solutions, and industrial machinery. Availability depends on the products offered.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-2="" class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-icon"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
