                    </svg></div>
                  <div class="faq-content">
                    <div class="font-medium is-faq">What engineering services can I explore?</div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="font-regular is-faq">Explore engineering and design, manufacturing and assembly, installation and commissioning, and ongoing maintenance support, each planned around your application.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-2="" class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-icon"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M12 4V20M20 12H4"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                  <div class="faq-content">
                    <div class="font-medium is-faq">Can I request a solution for my specific project?</div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="font-regular is-faq">Yes. Share your application, site conditions, and goals, and the team will review your requirements before recommending a practical direction.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-2="" class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-icon"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
