                    </svg></div>
                  <div class="faq-content">
                    <div class="font-medium is-faq">How do I request a quote for equipment?</div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                      <p class="font-regular is-faq">Use the contact form with your equipment needs, quantities, and timeline. The team will follow up to clarify details and prepare a quote.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-2="" class="faq-item">
